          "timestamp": "2026-11-18T14:08:06-07:00",
          "message": "fix(daemon): a fork-bomb registry that cannot be listed refuses an isolated boot, and no entry is left out of its count (v5fj) (#819)\n\n* fix(daemon): a fork-bomb registry or entry that cannot be read refuses an isolated boot, naming the error (v5fj)\n\n* fix(daemon): a fork-bomb registry entry is judged by the pid its name carries, so no entry is left out of the count (v5fj)\n\n* fix(daemon): a fork-bomb registry release removes our own entry, and an empty start time names no process (v5fj)\n\n* fix(daemon): the registry has one removal, whose failure the sweep warns of, and its entry name one spelling (v5fj)"
        }
      ]
